# Arm_P1 - P1's orange-tabby fur sleeve. The UI stretches it from the shoulder (below the screen) to the paw and
# tiles it vertically (Image Tiled, 2x), so the painting wraps top to bottom ('tile').
# Painted as a lit cylinder: light top-left, so the left outline catches light, a highlight band sits a third of the
# way in, and the form shadow is a crescent on the right with a thin reflected light before the dark outline.
# Tabby stripes are rings round the leg; the arm points away from the viewer, so each ring bows up in the middle.
# A stripe is the deep tone on the base and shadow, the shadow tone where it crosses the highlight.
# Columns match the cuff of Paw_P1_* (paw x = sleeve x + 6) so the paw joins seamlessly.
size 24 16
tile
key
  K #3a1a0a  ink: outline on the shadow side (the darkest fur tone)
  X #8f4c0d  deep fur: lit-side outline, core shadow, stripes in shadow
  H #ee8a5e  lit fur
  F #d67244  fur base
  S #bb612a  fur shadow, reflected light
draft
  X......................K
  X......................K
  X......................K
  X......................K
  X......................K
  X......................K
  X......................K
  X......................K
  X......................K
  X......................K
  X......................K
  X......................K
  X......................K
  X......................K
  X......................K
  X......................K
seeds
  F 11 8
ops
  # the highlight band, dragged down the lit side, then the rim just inside the outline turns away again
  band F H -1 0 5
  band =H F -1 0 1
  # the form shadow on the far side, its core, and the thin reflected light against the outline
  band F S 1 0 8
  band =S X 1 0 4
  band =X S 1 0 1
# tabby rings, placed by hand: a bold 2 px ring (top and bottom edges step together so it keeps its thickness,
# tapering to a point at each end) and a thin ring that breaks off before the highlight
shade
  ........................
  ........................
  ........................
  ........XXXXXXX.........
  .....SXXXXXXXXXXXX......
  ..SSSSXX.......XXXXXX...
  ...SS.............XX....
  ........................
  ........................
  ........................
  .........XXXXX..........
  ......XXX.....XXXX......
  ..................XXX...
  ........................
  ........................
  ........................
